_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326770/extras/86f8a0c8c0705586d95ca20b6065698e.poster.avif?t=1740348392\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326770/extras/86f8a0c8c0705586d95ca20b6065698e.webm?t=1740348392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326770/extras/86f8a0c8c0705586d95ca20b6065698e.mp4?t=1740348392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push yourself with the help of Steam Integration! Complete levels as faster than your friends and unlock every achievement the game offers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326770/extras/2a1db4546dc1e5b8d417280f874b10d6.poster.avif?t=1740348392\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326770/extras/2a1db4546dc1e5b8d417280f874b10d6.webm?t=1740348392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326770/extras/2a1db4546dc1e5b8d417280f874b10d6.mp4?t=1740348392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></p>",
